  from the Open Book of Laws on Hebrew Wikisource with the two gazette issues, as
  served by the Knesset's archive and by olaw.org.il, deposited beside it. The
  applicable source terms are UNDETERMINED, on the same question as
  il/penal-law-1977; see the row's encodings/legalese/SOURCE-LICENSE.md. The row
  quotes paragraph (3A) of the definition, reg. 169A's definition and s.62(3)
