  contracts/investment/yc-safe-premoney — the Y Combinator pre-money safe (the
  "original safe"), four US variants and the SAFE Primer, introduced in late 2013
  and superseded on 2018-09-28. Y Combinator no longer publishes these; the
  copies here were recovered from the Internet Archive.

  The applicable source terms are UNDETERMINED. Unlike the post-money row above,
  these documents state NO terms: every header and footer part of all four .docx
  is empty but for a page number, there is no copyright notice anywhere in the
  text, and the string "Y Combinator" does not appear in any of the four. The
  Creative Commons footer was added to the safe in 2018, four years after these
  captures. No attribution is recorded as required by any instrument, because
  none has been established — not because none is required, and not because
  silence is a grant. The forms are Y Combinator's work and are credited as such
  here as a matter of accuracy. See that row's SOURCE-LICENSE.md.

